# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale tr
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as the evening band.
# Surface: noun 'evening' -- the deictic form these phrases use.
# Source: Wiktionary, akşam — https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/akşam
akşam
# Surface: 3rd-person possessive "akşamı" ("its evening" / "the evening of
# <day>") -- the form the "<weekday> akşamı [saat ...]" construction uses
# ("salı akşamı saat 9'da" = "Tuesday evening at 9"). Same band as "akşam";
# Source: TDK Güncel Türkçe Sözlük, "akşam" + 3sg possessive -ı.
akşamı
